---
/** 2020년 버전의 oculusLogo.png(흰색 알약 심볼)를 벡터로 다시 그린 로고 */
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<span class:list={['logo', className]}>
  <svg class="logo__mark" viewBox="0 0 48 26" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <rect
      x="3.75"
      y="3.75"
      width="40.5"
      height="18.5"
      rx="9.25"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="7.5"
    ></rect>
  </svg>
  <span class="logo__text">oculus</span>
</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .logo__mark {
    inline-size: 2.1rem;
    block-size: auto;
  }

  .logo__text {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    translate: 0 -0.06em;
  }
</style>
